# Screen URLs (mandatory)

Every user-visible screen, tab, or in-page view must be reachable from the address bar and must restore on refresh. Do not keep the active screen only in React state.

Follow `.agents/skills/screen-urls/SKILL.md` when adding or changing screens.

```text
❌ BAD: const [tab, setTab] = useState('questions')  // refresh resets
✅ GOOD: searchParams.get('tab') || 'questions'     // /event/:id/matchmaking?tab=mapping
```

- Prefer `?tab=` (and extra query keys for nested views). Path segments are fine for distinct pages.
- Changing the screen must `setSearchParams` (keep other params). `LastPathTracker` already persists `pathname + search`.
- After this work: add the URL to `AI_FILE_MAP.yaml` `routes` and the feature README.
